#27100
Credits Room~
   This area has been created for several reasons.  The first reason, is this
is the first area that I've created and turned into the staff at RavenMUD.  
The second reason is that I felt there was a need for a elven camp of some sort
that was something like "the big brothers" of "the elven village" where Quintor
resides.  The third reason is that I hope this area can serve as a foundation
for other area's I have some desire to create.  The 01 room of this zone is
written to be where this zone is connected to the rest of the world, preferably
one-way through one of the portal 3968 chambers in the "Mystic Sea".  
Preferably, past an emerald guardian.  There is a &08plaque&00 on the wall
here.  This area is for level 30+ groups.    
~
271 1096 0 0 0 9 255 0
E
plaque~
This plaque shows what this world is meant to look like.  This is a node map.  
The end of each line is a room, each line is a passage way.
