#27101
Before the Meadow~
   As you pass through the portal you fight off the disorientation and glance 
behind you to peer back through, but all that you see is swirling rock in a 
cliff-face.  As you look, up, you see a large rocky cliff that is easily ten
times your height.  You bring your eyes back down to ground level and notice an
inviting, sparsely treed meadow lies directly to the north.  As you regain your
composure, you summise that you would prefer to not pass through solid rock
again anytime soon.
~
271 64 0 0 0 3 255 0
D0
An inviting, sparsely tree'd meadow lies to the north.
~
~
