#27102
Within the Lea~
  You are within a pleasant meadow of ankle high grasses.  The sounds of 
songbirds fills the air.  There is the occasional oak and maple tree scattered
about here.  You here the sounds of the occasional small woodland animal for a
moment.  The meadow stretches off into all directions.  You feel invited to lie
down and rest.
~
