#27137
The Writer's Post~
   This opening seems to be some sort of correspondence station.  This is where
the residents of this camp come to receive messages from home, and to send
message home.  There is a desk for the head of the post with some mail still on
it.  Amazingly, the crude furniture was made with no fasteners or bindings.  
They are made from pure uncut wood from the forest.  The impassable combination
of undergrowth and trees lies to the south and west of here, blocking your way.
It is doubtful that even a berserked troll would be able to crash through it.
  
