makeshift, yet well worn, desk here made from raw tree limbs.  It is of
ingenious design and uses no fasteners of any kind.  There are many scrolls
stashed into the bushes and trees that surround the desk.  The impassable
combination of undergrowth and trees lies to the north and west of here,
blocking your way.  It is doubtful that even a berserked troll would be able to
crash through it.    
