#27166
A Large Indigo Tent~
   You are in a large indigo tent that stretches off to the west.  There is a
door-flap to the south.  Judging by the many runes and odors, this is a mage's
tent.  This part of the tent is large enough to squeeze a dozen people into it.
There's a small opening in the top of the tent designed to let smoke out, but
not let rain or snow in.  There's a small fire burning in the middle of the
floor and many chests around the perimeter.    
~
