#27183
Resting quarters~
  You are in a large room that's up in the trees.  The ground below you is made 
of long woven green blades and is supported underneath by the living branches of 
the trees.  There is a makeshift wall of dried grasses to the south.  It is 
quiet up here.  None of the sounds from the camp below are detectable here.
  This seems to be the sleeping quarters for the camp.  There are many rows of 
makeshift beds made of feathers and grasses.  Every one seems to be the same, 
having no personalization.  There doesn't seem to be enough beds here for all 
the inhabitants of the camp to have their own.  
~
