#27188
In the Hut~
   You are inside a hut made of dead undergrowth and tree branches.  The walls
of the hut are thick as an ox and covered with many animal pelts.  You realize
that you don't hear any outside noises within the hut.  There is a small stone
forge in the center of the room, with an ingenious vent that nearly eliminates
the release of smoke.    
~
